7. User Roles & Permissions

7.1 Citizen

Permissions:

- Register an account
- Log in
- Report infrastructure issues
- Upload issue photographs
- Provide issue location
- Select or confirm issue category
- View own reported issues
- Track issue status
- View issue history
- Receive notifications

Cannot:

- Manage other users
- Assign officers
- Manage departments
- Manage system categories
- Access administrator functions

---

7.2 Municipal Officer

Permissions:

- Log in
- View assigned issues
- View issue details
- View photographs and locations
- Verify complaints
- Update issue status
- Add resolution information
- Mark assigned issues as resolved

Cannot:

- Manage administrator accounts
- Manage the complete system configuration
- Access unrestricted administrator functions

---

7.3 Administrator

Permissions:

- Log in
- Manage users
- Manage officers
- Manage issue categories
- Manage departments
- Assign issues to officers
- View all reported issues
- Monitor complaint progress
- View system statistics
- Manage application-level data

